The directories here are organised based on different applications of mescaline
See the individual README files in each src directory for more info

Each src directory has its own options_<dirname>.f90 file which must be changed according to your choices before compiling

Currently, only spatial averaging is available (avgs/). Expect more additions in the future!

tyrosine/ contains code that all of the mescaline applications use
(Tyrosine is essential to making mescaline work: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mescaline)
